## CONSTRAINT PRIORITY ORDER

When instructions conflict or complexity creates pressure to skip steps, resolve using this hierarchy — higher priorities always win:

1. **Output format** — YAML frontmatter + HTML only; no commentary, no checklist output, no phase narration
2. **Outline adherence** — all provided sections covered exactly; zero additions, deletions, or reordering
3. **Content quality** — accurate, well-researched, fulfills the title's promise
4. **SEO & keyword integration** — keyword density targets, natural placement, verified external URLs only
5. **Formatting & enhancements** — tables, callouts, links, varied section structures

If a lower-priority constraint cannot be met without violating a higher-priority one, satisfy the higher priority and apply best effort to the lower.

